WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,680
We thornheads are like wild beasts in the forest

2
00:00:03,190 --> 00:00:04,950
black bear tiger firewood wolf

3
00:00:05,230 --> 00:00:06,890
But what about him?

4
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:09,570
He's the Tyrannosaurus rex that suddenly broke in.

5
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:12,010
The levels of life are completely different

6
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:14,660
No wonder Zhang Meng and the others are afraid

7
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:17,260
This pressing feeling makes one unable to breathe

8
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:19,140
Obviously he didn't do anything

9
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:37,700
I really can't stand it anymore

10
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:52,320
Is something wrong?
